WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:16.617
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
'Life as a Major' theme song]

2
00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:31.062
[Noise of the city]

3
00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:33.933
[lively music]

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.370
(Lee Young) Oh, I don’t have time.

5
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.841
(Dowon) The restaurant reservation is for 5 o’clock.
There's still one hour left?

6
00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.618
Why are you suddenly looking for a house?

7
00:00:43.685 --> 00:00:47.000
Before starting the original fellow
I was going to move in front of the hospital.

8
00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.567
no

9
00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:51.084
I'm so busy these days that I barely watch it at home.

10
00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.404
I see you every day at the hospital.

11
00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.484
(Do-won) Oh I-young, do you like me that much?

12
00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:02.629
yes

13
00:01:02.696 --> 00:01:03.697
Why is that?

14
00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.299
Me too

15
00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:12.272
(Lee Young) Do you know how to say something like that?

16
00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.133
Since we met

17
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.676
each other at home

18
00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.600
I feel very uncomfortable
You know it feels awkward, right?

19
00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:21.567
Isn't it?
I'm very comfortable and I like it a lot, right?

20
00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:22.749
[Do-won laughs]

21
00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.167
(Dowon) I wore it every day
I'm not even wearing a t-shirt with a stretched neck

22
00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:27.333
Don't lie down on the sofa

23
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.189
I have to sleep so I can come out and wash up.

24
00:01:32.434 --> 00:01:35.562
Regardless of my brother and sister-in-law
Is it right for me to come out?

25
00:01:37.601 --> 00:01:39.333
[Lee Young sighs]
And when I find a house

26
00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:42.771
There's a place for just the two of us

27
00:01:44.512 --> 00:01:45.417
Two?

28
00:01:45.906 --> 00:01:46.945
Alone?

29
00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:49.676
What should I do?
[Dowon’s laughter]

30
00:01:49.743 --> 00:01:51.743
[Exciting music]

31
00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:54.681
That's not what I meant.

32
00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:56.116
[Slams the table] Write a contract today

33
00:01:56.183 --> 00:01:57.317
Let's move next week

34
00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:00.253
Oh, boss, what time is it and aren’t you coming?

35
00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.789
(Lee Young) How many hours
Waiting, now...

36
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.826
(At school) I didn’t mean to listen to it.

37
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.569
Hello?

38
00:02:08.636 --> 00:02:09.574
(Dowon) Hello?

39
00:02:09.641 --> 00:02:11.567
(current student) I am also a customer, yes

40
00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:14.401
The owner went to show the house for a moment.
He'll be back soon

41
00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:16.670
Oh yes, thank you

42
00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:20.541
(Students) Write, what did you come to see?

43
00:02:22.476 --> 00:02:25.634
Ah, a small apartment for rent or monthly rent.

44
00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:28.100
Oh, about 20 pyeong?

45
00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:29.750
- Yes
- (current student) Yes

46
00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:34.407
Where is the neighborhood?

47
00:02:38.335 --> 00:02:39.200
Pyeongbuk-dong...

48
00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:40.667
Pyeongbuk-dong?

49
00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:42.066
There is a Jongno Yulje there, right?

50
00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:43.546
- (Dowon) Yes
- (Lee Young) Huh?

51
00:02:45.599 --> 00:02:48.301
The neighborhood there is so nice.
[Jaehak’s laughter]

52
00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:50.434
Ah, why are there so many places to go nearby?

53
00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:52.272
There's no better place to live as a newlywed.

54
00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:54.867
It's not a newlywed house.

55
00:02:54.934 --> 00:02:56.343
(Students) Uh, ah, sorry.

56
00:02:56.901 --> 00:02:59.901
Oh, me again
The two have very similar drawings

57
00:02:59.968 --> 00:03:01.600
They fit together so well
[Jaehak’s light smile]

58
00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:02.949
[Dowon and Lee Young’s embarrassed laughter]

59
00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.218
No, I know that neighborhood well.

60
00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:08.033
There's a melody apartment there.

61
00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.600
The location is good and the landscaping is good.

62
00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:12.426
Besides, it's top quality.

63
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:13.933
Superb...

64
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.862
Apartment with an elementary school

65
00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:18.066
I love raising kids!

66
00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:19.366
A kid? A kid?

67
00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.167
(Attending school) Ah, Chopum-ah is cancelled.

68
00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:23.000
[Jaehak’s light smile]

69
00:03:23.067 --> 00:03:24.933
And is it good feng shui?

70
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.740
Are you saying everything is going well?

71
00:03:26.807 --> 00:03:29.309
[Interesting music]
Especially that 215 building

72
00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:31.233
Even if it faces south, hold it well.

73
00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.447
Because it is plate-shaped, it is well ventilated.

74
00:03:35.549 --> 00:03:37.233
How good is the floor?

75
00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:40.554
Just the middle 12th floor, no noise between floors.

76
00:03:40.621 --> 00:03:42.767
The neighbors are so nice.

77
00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:43.890
Besides

78
00:03:44.701 --> 00:03:46.193
A bit cheaper than the surrounding area

79
00:03:52.584 --> 00:03:54.334
[Sound of swallowing]
Like this?

80
00:03:54.401 --> 00:03:55.369
uh?

81
00:03:56.904 --> 00:03:59.867
No, it’s so good, why is it cheap?

82
00:03:59.934 --> 00:04:01.901
Oh, the landlord is nice.

83
00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.111
Are you in a hurry again?

84
00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:07.714
(Students) How, do you want to go see it now?
I can show you right away

85
00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:09.700
(Dowon) By any chance?

86
00:04:09.767 --> 00:04:12.100
Yes, I am the owner, it is my house.

87
00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:13.820
[Lee Young snorts]
That's right, that's right

88
00:04:14.701 --> 00:04:16.556
I’m also someone who watches the news, right?

89
00:04:17.764 --> 00:04:19.133
cadet! cadet!

90
00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.794
I, uh, I'm not that kind of person.

91
00:04:21.467 --> 00:04:24.164
(Students) Ah, I really saw it for the first time.
It's a bit awkward to talk like this

92
00:04:24.231 --> 00:04:25.797
I'm a victim

93
00:04:26.434 --> 00:04:29.035
Yes, I am a victim of rent fraud.

94
00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.600
How much pain did I go through back then?

95
00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:33.233
Actually, my wife at that time

96
00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.467
It must have hurt

97
00:04:34.534 --> 00:04:36.834
I just went to the hospital and had surgery.

98
00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.445
[surprised] How did you know?

99
00:04:38.512 --> 00:04:40.992
With the repertoire of scammers I saw on the news
Because it's the same

100
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:43.450
[sigh]

101
00:04:44.521 --> 00:04:45.919
Since I was scammed

102
00:04:46.801 --> 00:04:48.333
If it's a real charter, I'm shaking.

103
00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.490
I am a person who bought a house with a full loan.

104
00:04:50.557 --> 00:04:52.392
I will also take a copy of the register and show it to you.

105
00:04:52.459 --> 00:04:54.233
You don't have anything mortgaged, okay?

106
00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.901
Show me my ID too.

107
00:04:55.968 --> 00:04:57.764
(Attending school) Are you going to sign up for warranty insurance again?

108
00:04:58.267 --> 00:04:59.267
sleep, wait, wait

109
00:04:59.334 --> 00:05:00.567
No, no, wait a minute.

110
00:05:00.634 --> 00:05:01.966
[humorous music]
Oh, it's not really true

111
00:05:02.033 --> 00:05:03.600
Oh, I really like my house

112
00:05:03.667 --> 00:05:05.467
(Lee Young) Please stop.
That person bites

113
00:05:05.534 --> 00:05:07.107
(Dowon) Oh, ah! no!

114
00:05:07.174 --> 00:05:08.801
[Dog growling sound effect]

115
00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:09.943
It's really going to bite you.

116
00:05:10.811 --> 00:05:11.875
We have work to do

117
00:05:12.868 --> 00:05:14.100
(Students) No, even if I go
You need to resolve the misunderstanding.

118
00:05:14.167 --> 00:05:15.749
(Lee Young) Ah, this person is real!
[Sound effect of dog barking]

119
00:05:15.816 --> 00:05:17.033
(Dowon) Calm down

120
00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.018
calm

121
00:05:18.552 --> 00:05:19.571
That's right

122
00:05:20.821 --> 00:05:23.389
[Sound of door opening and closing]

123
00:05:23.456 --> 00:05:25.725
No, what do you think, am I a fraud?

124
00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:27.194
You look so nice

125
00:05:28.501 --> 00:05:29.629
[Sound of door opening]

126
00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.631
(Students) Uh, boss

127
00:05:31.698 --> 00:05:33.167
(Real estate owner) Uh, uh, you waited a long time, right?

128
00:05:33.234 --> 00:05:34.568
sorry, sorry

129
00:05:34.635 --> 00:05:36.603
(Students) No one comes to see our house.

130
00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.405
I really need to move

131
00:05:38.472 --> 00:05:40.400
Ah, is that how I want it to be?

132
00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:43.567
Oh, it's already been three months since I put that house on the market.

133
00:05:43.634 --> 00:05:46.500
(Students) Before our second child was born
I have to move

134
00:05:46.567 --> 00:05:48.066
Oh, okay, just wait.

135
00:05:48.133 --> 00:05:51.867
(Students) Ah, ah, ah, boss
[Real estate owner's absurd moans]

136
00:05:51.934 --> 00:05:53.453
- Hey, hey...
- (Real Estate Owner) Oh, why are you like this?

137
00:05:54.534 --> 00:05:56.534
[Elegant music plays]

138
00:06:08.334 --> 00:06:09.970
I almost got scammed earlier

139
00:06:11.334 --> 00:06:13.167
I was surprised when I ate it.

140
00:06:13.234 --> 00:06:14.500
Ah!

141
00:06:14.567 --> 00:06:16.467
If you're surprised, you have to eat a lot, basically.

142
00:06:16.534 --> 00:06:17.577
(Dowon) I need to calm him down.

143
00:06:19.734 --> 00:06:20.680
Eat a lot

144
00:06:21.601 --> 00:06:22.549
yes

145
00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:29.122
Huh? what?

146
00:06:30.157 --> 00:06:31.525
Well, what's on it?

147
00:06:32.501 --> 00:06:35.734
(Dowon) Oh, something like this
Are you buried?

148
00:06:35.801 --> 00:06:36.901
Well...

149
00:06:36.968 --> 00:06:37.964
Everything was wiped

150
00:06:47.033 --> 00:06:48.375
fourth finger is 10

151
00:06:49.392 --> 00:06:51.211
(Lee Young) More than I thought
My fingers are thin

152
00:06:51.278 --> 00:06:54.014
So stop this
Eat quickly, eat quickly.

153
00:06:55.767 --> 00:06:58.933
Ha, well, what are you talking about?
You have no idea?

154
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.933
I really have something on my finger
Did you wipe it?

155
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.133
Are you looking to buy a couple ring?
As a surprise?

156
00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.333
[Embarrassed] Well, ah, no?

157
00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.861
But why
Are you suddenly measuring your finger size?

158
00:07:07.928 --> 00:07:09.366
(Lee Young) And secretly?
[Dowon’s embarrassed groan]

159
00:07:09.433 --> 00:07:11.231
Can't you just pretend not to know?

160
00:07:14.968 --> 00:07:16.737
Oh, I have something to give you too.

161
00:07:21.119 --> 00:07:21.966
salty

162
00:07:22.033 --> 00:07:23.043
What is this?

163
00:07:27.167 --> 00:07:28.849
(Dowon) Oh, it’s pretty.

164
00:07:29.598 --> 00:07:31.518
How did you know my foot size?

165
00:07:31.585 --> 00:07:32.786
(Lee Young) You know that without even measuring it.

166
00:07:33.267 --> 00:07:34.487
(Dowon) How...

167
00:07:35.455 --> 00:07:37.123
We share a shoe cabinet.

168
00:07:38.133 --> 00:07:39.125
That's right

169
00:07:40.033 --> 00:07:41.061
Try them on

170
00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:57.144
(Dowon) Oh, what!
[Lee Young’s laughter]

171
00:07:57.211 --> 00:07:58.801
[Thump sound]
(Male customer’s daughter) Dad

172
00:07:58.868 --> 00:08:00.347
(Male customer’s wife) Honey

173
00:08:00.414 --> 00:08:01.434
[nervous music]
What's wrong?

174
00:08:01.501 --> 00:08:02.616
(Male customer’s daughter) Dad

175
00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:05.051
Please help me here!

176
00:08:05.118 --> 00:08:06.534
(Male customer’s wife) Ah, honey.

177
00:08:06.601 --> 00:08:07.333
[Male customer groans with difficulty]

178
00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.534
(Dowon) Why are you doing that?
What's stuck in your throat?

179
00:08:09.601 --> 00:08:12.600
(Daughter of male customer) Meat.
While eating meat, suddenly

180
00:08:12.667 --> 00:08:14.728
[Guests murmuring]
[Male customer groans with difficulty]

181
00:08:15.629 --> 00:08:17.100
- (Lee Young) Please call 119, quickly.
- (Employee) Yes

182
00:08:17.167 --> 00:08:18.331
- (Dowon) Please catch me.
- (Male customer's wife) Oh, honey!

183
00:08:19.032 --> 00:08:20.097
[Guests’ surprised exclamations]

184
00:08:20.601 --> 00:08:22.667
(Dowon) Teacher, can you hear me?

185
00:08:22.734 --> 00:08:23.703
teacher?

186
00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:28.909
- Maintain the airway first.
- (Lee Young) Yes

187
00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:37.884
(Employee) The ambulance will be here soon.

188
00:08:41.321 --> 00:08:43.290
- I need a spoon.
- (Employee) Oh, spoon.

189
00:08:49.162 --> 00:08:50.196
[Sound of spoons rolling]

190
00:08:54.859 --> 00:08:56.636
[Male customer groans with difficulty]
(Lee Young) Wait a minute

191
00:08:58.272 --> 00:08:59.839
[Male customer groans with difficulty]

192
00:09:00.634 --> 00:09:01.975
ROSC is done

193
00:09:03.734 --> 00:09:06.246
(Dowon) Teacher, can you hear me?

194
00:09:09.316 --> 00:09:10.383
[Guests’ exclamations of relief]

195
00:09:11.158 --> 00:09:12.152
(Guest 1) You’re welcome.

196
00:09:12.219 --> 00:09:14.888
The ambulance will arrive soon and take you to the hospital.

197
00:09:15.522 --> 00:09:17.824
You'll be okay, don't worry.
[Ambulance siren sound]

198
00:09:17.891 --> 00:09:19.459
(Employee) Oh, here we come.

199
00:09:19.526 --> 00:09:21.194
Here, here!

200
00:09:21.261 --> 00:09:22.796
(Male customer’s wife) Honey, are you okay?

201
00:09:24.131 --> 00:09:25.432
[The male customer’s wife sighs in relief]
(Daughter of male customer) Thank you

202
00:09:25.499 --> 00:09:26.633
(Employee) This way, this way!

203
00:09:27.267 --> 00:09:28.868
[Guests murmuring]

204
00:09:32.072 --> 00:09:33.440
(Guest 2) I’m glad.

205
00:09:33.507 --> 00:09:35.408
(Guest 3) I’m glad you came quickly.

206
00:09:35.475 --> 00:09:38.078
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
'Life as a Major' theme song]

207
00:09:47.287 --> 00:09:48.521
[yawn]

208
00:09:50.167 --> 00:09:52.033
[lively music]

209
00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.867
(Dowon) I told you to sleep for at least one more hour.

210
00:09:53.934 --> 00:09:55.829
(Lee Young) I don’t have time to meet you this week.

211
00:09:56.367 --> 00:09:57.931
We have to go to work together at least.

212
00:09:59.433 --> 00:10:00.967
Do you have time for coffee?

213
00:10:02.436 --> 00:10:04.537
Around 5:15?

214
00:10:07.274 --> 00:10:08.182
(Dowon) Here...

215
00:10:09.868 --> 00:10:11.434
You washed your face, right?

216
00:10:11.501 --> 00:10:12.979
I couldn't do it

217
00:10:13.046 --> 00:10:14.093
Just go and do it.

218
00:10:15.382 --> 00:10:18.155
[Sound of approaching footsteps]

219
00:10:18.222 --> 00:10:19.100
cute

220
00:10:19.167 --> 00:10:20.734
(Lee Young) Ugh

221
00:10:20.801 --> 00:10:21.855
(Chaeryeong) Hey, maybe

222
00:10:21.922 --> 00:10:24.324
[Sound of approaching footsteps]

223
00:10:26.868 --> 00:10:28.295
(Dowon) Yes?

224
00:10:28.362 --> 00:10:31.267
Oh, what floor is the outpatient department over there?
May I ask you a question?

225
00:10:31.334 --> 00:10:32.767
(Dowon) Ah, that...

226
00:10:32.834 --> 00:10:33.767
[Dowon’s sigh]

227
00:10:35.068 --> 00:10:36.333
Other... Ah, it's the second floor.

228
00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.434
You can go by elevator.

229
00:10:38.501 --> 00:10:40.740
(Chaeryeong) Ah, yes, thank you

230
00:10:53.601 --> 00:10:55.601
[Interesting music]

231
00:10:59.593 --> 00:11:03.534
(Chaeryeong) Starting today, I will be working in the delivery room.
This is nurse Chaeryeong Lee.

232
00:11:03.601 --> 00:11:04.945
Please take care of me in the future

233
00:11:05.012 --> 00:11:06.366
(Nanjing) Wow

234
00:11:06.433 --> 00:11:07.966
(Dahye) Please take care of us too.

235
00:11:08.033 --> 00:11:11.333
Oh, if there's something you don't know
You can ask all of our first-year students.

236
00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.233
(Namkyung) Uh, yes, ask anything.

237
00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:16.000
Something like hospital rescue
People's names, etc.

238
00:11:16.067 --> 00:11:17.410
I'll tell you everything I know

239
00:11:17.477 --> 00:11:18.244
Thank you

240
00:11:18.311 --> 00:11:21.348
Anyway, come early today
I saw you were looking around.

241
00:11:21.415 --> 00:11:22.700
I felt like I was going to get lost a lot.

242
00:11:22.767 --> 00:11:24.885
No, what time did you go to work?

243
00:11:24.952 --> 00:11:27.454
(Dahye) [Surprise] Be diligent too.
Right?

244
00:11:27.521 --> 00:11:29.867
(Chaeryeong) I will work harder and harder

245
00:11:29.934 --> 00:11:31.359
thank you for your welcome

246
00:11:31.426 --> 00:11:33.527
Let’s eat together sometime soon.

247
00:11:33.594 --> 00:11:35.161
[Eunmi’s light smile]
(Namkyung) See you again

248
00:11:36.033 --> 00:11:38.364
- (Jiyoung) Nice to meet you
- (Minjoo) Let’s have lunch together later.

249
00:11:49.443 --> 00:11:50.610
[Lee Young sighs]

250
00:11:51.144 --> 00:11:53.246
[Mouse operation sound]

251
00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.384
Nice to see you here again, sir.

252
00:11:59.253 --> 00:12:00.806
