Where did Eom Jae-il go?

510
00:22:37.100 --> 00:22:39.825
(Sabi) I heard you’re going to sleep right after the surgery?
He said he stayed up all night for a few days

511
00:22:41.595 --> 00:22:42.652
[light sigh]

512
00:23:06.720 --> 00:23:08.254
[Sound of doctors snoring]

513
00:23:10.724 --> 00:23:12.011
[Jaeil’s sigh]
[The sound of doctors snoring - continued]

514
00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:16.362
[Sound of door closing]

515
00:23:19.466 --> 00:23:21.466
[Lonely music]

516
00:23:40.434 --> 00:23:42.788
[light music]

517
00:23:55.667 --> 00:23:57.400
(Residence in Japan) Huh? Uh, huh?

518
00:23:57.467 --> 00:23:58.601
[Jaeil’s scream]

519
00:23:58.668 --> 00:23:59.773
Please save me!

520
00:23:59.840 --> 00:24:01.974
There's someone here!

521
00:24:02.968 --> 00:24:05.077
[Sabi’s urgent breathing]

522
00:24:05.579 --> 00:24:06.512
[Moaning in pain]

523
00:24:08.668 --> 00:24:11.016
[humorous music]
[Jaeil’s sigh]

524
00:24:11.818 --> 00:24:14.087
[Jaeil’s heavy breathing]

525
00:24:14.154 --> 00:24:15.273
Save me

526
00:24:17.758 --> 00:24:19.057
Oh, me

527
00:24:19.124 --> 00:24:21.393
[Jaeil groans in pain]

528
00:24:22.094 --> 00:24:24.430
(Residing in Japan) Patients
Sometimes after laparoscopic surgery

529
00:24:25.254 --> 00:24:27.901
He said his legs were numb
They say they feel paralyzed.

530
00:24:27.968 --> 00:24:29.000
That's real

531
00:24:29.067 --> 00:24:30.437
me now
[sound of thigh tapping]

532
00:24:30.504 --> 00:24:31.537
I can't feel it

533
00:24:32.806 --> 00:24:35.474
(Sabi) I ate breakfast and drank coffee.
I went to the convenience store

534
00:24:35.541 --> 00:24:37.209
Now that I'm done, can I go?

535
00:24:38.178 --> 00:24:39.155
(Jay) Wait a minute

536
00:24:40.781 --> 00:24:41.794
Uh...

537
00:24:42.616 --> 00:24:44.432
I wear this gown

538
00:24:46.320 --> 00:24:47.371
[sigh]

539
00:24:51.590 --> 00:24:52.625
[Sabi’s sigh]

540
00:24:59.933 --> 00:25:00.898
[light sigh]

541
00:25:06.740 --> 00:25:08.740
[Calm music]
[Taps his collar]

542
00:25:12.513 --> 00:25:13.458
Thank you

543
00:25:14.481 --> 00:25:15.394
Hey

544
00:25:18.352 --> 00:25:19.919
That's a pen

545
00:25:23.756 --> 00:25:25.324
(Sabi) It’s really done, right? Going

546
00:25:26.226 --> 00:25:27.426
(Japanese) Kim Sa-bi

547
00:25:27.493 --> 00:25:28.633
If you go now, when will you come?

548
00:25:28.700 --> 00:25:29.728
At lunch?

549
00:25:30.230 --> 00:25:32.397
Or do you come back after surgery at 4 o'clock?

550
00:25:32.464 --> 00:25:33.366
You're not coming?

551
00:25:33.433 --> 00:25:34.467
Then what should I do with food?

552
00:25:34.534 --> 00:25:35.801
Eat on your own

553
00:25:35.868 --> 00:25:37.369
I won't eat today

554
00:25:38.570 --> 00:25:41.208
(Jaeil) I’m not good at this yet.

555
00:25:41.275 --> 00:25:42.734
How do I get to the restaurant alone?

556
00:25:42.801 --> 00:25:44.744
All patients take care of themselves.

557
00:25:44.811 --> 00:25:45.679
Hey

558
00:25:45.746 --> 00:25:46.979
[Dog whining sound effect]

559
00:25:49.283 --> 00:25:50.283
Okay

560
00:25:50.350 --> 00:25:52.052
You can call me after the surgery.

561
00:25:52.119 --> 00:25:53.266
Must you come?

562
00:25:53.333 --> 00:25:54.100
I'm waiting

563
00:25:54.167 --> 00:25:55.120
Got it!

564
00:25:56.767 --> 00:25:59.124
(Sabi) Ah, Eom Jae-il!
This is so annoying, Mr.! Tsk!

565
00:26:01.827 --> 00:26:02.728
Come back!

566
00:26:08.202 --> 00:26:09.101
Oh, what a surprise.

567
00:26:09.570 --> 00:26:10.571
Ah

568
00:26:13.472 --> 00:26:16.642
Oh, I have to go see Gu Yun-ja, right?

569
00:26:17.309 --> 00:26:18.510
- Yes
- (Japan) Hmm

570
00:26:19.211 --> 00:26:23.300
(Juyeon) Write, something to feel good about today
I don’t think there will be much, right?

571
00:26:23.367 --> 00:26:24.683
You look in a good mood?

572
00:26:24.750 --> 00:26:26.118
Isn't it?

573
00:26:26.185 --> 00:26:27.519
me now

574
00:26:28.187 --> 00:26:30.556
It hurts so much and I feel ashamed

575
00:26:31.467 --> 00:26:32.925
I can't lift my face?

576
00:26:35.762 --> 00:26:36.824
[Awkward laughter]

577
00:26:37.564 --> 00:26:38.461
Let's go quickly

578
00:26:43.435 --> 00:26:46.406
(Yunja) I happened to heal people
Did they catch someone?

579
00:26:46.473 --> 00:26:47.700
[laughter]

580
00:26:47.767 --> 00:26:49.109
don't worry about me

581
00:26:49.176 --> 00:26:50.776
It'll be okay soon
[Yunja’s light smile]

582
00:26:51.877 --> 00:26:54.579
(Jae-il) Ah, if I continue this anti-cancer treatment for a long time,

583
00:26:54.646 --> 00:26:57.215
The skin on your hands and feet can peel off like this.

584
00:26:57.282 --> 00:26:59.518
I will prescribe an ointment for you to apply.

585
00:26:59.585 --> 00:27:00.619
yes

586
00:27:02.387 --> 00:27:03.690
Hey, but

587
00:27:03.757 --> 00:27:07.593
(Yunja) The person who came with me for chemotherapy
Our 4-person room mates

588
00:27:08.467 --> 00:27:09.695
(Jay) Um...

589
00:27:11.131 --> 00:27:12.194
Ah

590
00:27:12.699 --> 00:27:14.866
Didn't you make it to your schedule this time?

591
00:27:14.933 --> 00:27:16.203
ah!

592
00:27:16.270 --> 00:27:19.267
From this cancer treatment
Did you say you were going to another hospital?

593
00:27:19.334 --> 00:27:21.006
[Awkward laughter]

594
00:27:21.073 --> 00:27:22.775
I really can't lie

595
00:27:24.278 --> 00:27:25.778
Because everyone went?

596
00:27:27.120 --> 00:27:28.166
yes

597
00:27:28.767 --> 00:27:29.815
Did you hear?

598
00:27:29.882 --> 00:27:31.717
(Yunja) Sookja, who was hospitalized over there,

599
00:27:32.253 --> 00:27:33.634
I went there last month

600
00:27:33.701 --> 00:27:35.587
[Calm music]
Geunyoung, who lives in Namyangju, also

601
00:27:36.088 --> 00:27:37.856
He said he went away after receiving that anti-cancer drug.

602
00:27:39.367 --> 00:27:40.225
yes

603
00:27:40.727 --> 00:27:42.261
They say you have acute sepsis.

604
00:27:43.762 --> 00:27:45.330
When I last saw you

605
00:27:45.397 --> 00:27:48.200
(Yunja) Smiling brightly
Waving your hands energetically

606
00:27:48.669 --> 00:27:50.604
I said I'd be there soon

607
00:27:52.471 --> 00:27:55.707
(Japan) Still, our patient
The tumor size has decreased significantly.

608
00:27:56.235 --> 00:27:57.534
I think this medicine works well for me

609
00:27:57.601 --> 00:27:58.844
[Yoonja crying]

610
00:27:58.911 --> 00:28:00.012
(Yunja) Is it true?

611
00:28:01.181 --> 00:28:03.815
For no reason do you tell me to cheer up
You're not lying, are you?

612
00:28:03.882 --> 00:28:05.383
Oh, sure

613
00:28:05.450 --> 00:28:06.451
Why do I lie so needlessly...

614
00:28:06.518 --> 00:28:08.989
(Miyoung) I have no energy because I haven’t eaten!

615
00:28:09.056 --> 00:28:11.556
(Mija) If I die anyway, my body will rot.

616
00:28:11.623 --> 00:28:14.693
What did you keep telling me to eat?

617
00:28:14.760 --> 00:28:16.328
[Miyoung’s sigh]
[Yunja’s sniffling]

618
00:28:16.395 --> 00:28:17.763
Fight again, fight again

619
00:28:18.263 --> 00:28:20.167
(Yunja) [Sniffling] Hey, go.

620
00:28:20.234 --> 00:28:23.303
- The teacher has to stop it, who should stop it?
- Yes

621
00:28:23.370 --> 00:28:26.805
(Miyoung) I have to eat to gain strength
They say they do anti-cancer treatment.

622
00:28:26.872 --> 00:28:28.607
(Mija) I don’t receive it from the inside.

623
00:28:28.674 --> 00:28:30.676
Are you coming in just to eat?

624
00:28:32.901 --> 00:28:34.147
[Miyoung’s sigh]

625
00:28:34.214 --> 00:28:35.280
(Jae-il) Hello?

626
00:28:36.114 --> 00:28:37.651
Why again today?

627
00:28:37.718 --> 00:28:40.886
(Miyoung) Because I don’t eat like that.
A disease that is completely cured arises again

628
00:28:41.787 --> 00:28:44.589
(Mija) So I
Don't you just say you'll die?

629
00:28:44.656 --> 00:28:46.325
That sound of death

630
00:28:46.960 --> 00:28:48.861
I've been listening for at least 10 years

631
00:28:49.696 --> 00:28:51.363
I want to go that way

632
00:28:51.430 --> 00:28:53.832
Let’s go instead of putting our younger brother through trouble!

633
00:28:54.734 --> 00:28:57.602
Patient, do you have trouble eating?

634
00:28:57.669 --> 00:29:00.005
(Miyoung) I stopped eating and drinking since yesterday.

635
00:29:00.072 --> 00:29:02.140
They say you have to eat it to fight cancer.

636
00:29:02.207 --> 00:29:04.009
You can't even hear what I'm saying

637
00:29:05.367 --> 00:29:06.345
my grandmother

638
00:29:06.979 --> 00:29:08.313
You have to eat well, right?

639
00:29:08.814 --> 00:29:11.817
He said it was difficult to pass up food.
I changed it to porridge.

640
00:29:12.517 --> 00:29:14.319
(Jaeil) You have to eat well to start treatment.

641
00:29:14.386 --> 00:29:16.121
Get better quickly and go home.

642
00:29:17.034 --> 00:29:19.525
Gotta go, gotta go home

643
00:29:20.125 --> 00:29:23.730
Seongchan, don’t worry too much about mom.

644
00:29:23.797 --> 00:29:27.901
(Mija) What are you doing?
Did you come to the hospital carrying this heavy thing?

645
00:29:27.968 --> 00:29:30.805
It must be hard to go to school
[Jaeil’s embarrassed laughter]

646
00:29:30.872 --> 00:29:33.340
(Miyoung) [Clicking tongue] Doing that again, again

647
00:29:33.407 --> 00:29:36.042
Yesterday, I cried loudly, saying it was my father.

648
00:29:36.109 --> 00:29:37.442
Is it your son today?

649
00:29:38.744 --> 00:29:40.413
Sister's son Seongchan

650
00:29:40.480 --> 00:29:44.183
My mom for 10 years
You just ordered me to take care of the sick and left.

651
00:29:44.751 --> 00:29:45.735
Did you forget?

652
00:29:47.955 --> 00:29:49.074
damn bitch

653
00:29:49.855 --> 00:29:51.590
(Mija) Is that something you should say in front of a child?

654
00:29:52.534 --> 00:29:55.527
The aunt who ate 50
Are you saying this in front of your nephew?

655
00:29:56.129 --> 00:29:59.598
(Miyoung) Sister, I’m 70 this evening

656
00:29:59.665 --> 00:30:00.667
Huh?

657
00:30:00.734 --> 00:30:03.715
Wow, that old man is really crazy, ugh.

658
00:30:04.703 --> 00:30:05.571
[sigh]

659
00:30:06.271 --> 00:30:09.241
But do you know why your aunt is like this?

660
00:30:09.734 --> 00:30:10.644
[muttering sound]

661
00:30:10.711 --> 00:30:11.845
[Jaeil’s light smile]

662
00:30:11.912 --> 00:30:14.400
- (Jaeil) Yes, I know.
- (Mija) Yes

663
00:30:14.467 --> 00:30:16.248
Be sure to eat porridge today

664
00:30:19.635 --> 00:30:20.587
Mother?

665
00:30:21.288 --> 00:30:22.441
[Jaeil’s light smile]
[Calm music]

666
00:30:36.370 --> 00:30:37.536
[sigh]

667
00:30:38.872 --> 00:30:41.773
(Dawn) Ah...
Thank you for helping me with the surgery, professor.

668
00:30:41.840 --> 00:30:45.143
Did you overdo it yesterday?
My stomach is a little tight

669
00:30:45.210 --> 00:30:47.045
(Jeongmin) I only did the pundal, well.

670
00:30:47.612 --> 00:30:49.147
But are you okay?

671
00:30:49.214 --> 00:30:50.326
(Dawn) Yes

672
00:30:50.393 --> 00:30:51.542
(Lee Young) I don’t think so.

673
00:30:52.284 --> 00:30:54.087
You've been in pain since morning

674
00:30:54.154 --> 00:30:55.621
You didn't look good either.

675
00:30:57.133 --> 00:30:58.957
It looks like pain to me.

676
00:30:59.024 --> 00:31:01.246
You insist that you have it
You keep working

677
00:31:02.527 --> 00:31:03.997
(Jeongmin) Oh, Oh Iyoung

678
00:31:04.064 --> 00:31:06.431
This is Professor Keum Saebyeok’s doctor, right?

679
00:31:06.967 --> 00:31:08.034
(Lee Young) Yes

680
00:31:08.101 --> 00:31:10.002
But you don't listen to your doctor at all.

681
00:31:10.537 --> 00:31:12.572
(Dawn) Now, Teacher Oh I-young?

682
00:31:12.639 --> 00:31:15.040
Uh, we had a study session last time.

683
00:31:15.107 --> 00:31:18.643
The pain is like the pain of contractions
There can be regularity

684
00:31:18.710 --> 00:31:21.615
But now it’s naturally disappearing.

685
00:31:21.682 --> 00:31:23.582
This is a mess, okay?

686
00:31:24.767 --> 00:31:25.884
Okay

687
00:31:25.951 --> 00:31:27.919
So you can still do more work?

688
00:31:27.986 --> 00:31:30.700
Yes, I have a lot of things to organize right now.

689
00:31:30.767 --> 00:31:32.290
The due date is next Wednesday.

690
00:31:32.357 --> 00:31:34.861
Wow, I don't know if I'll be able to finish it by then.

691
00:31:34.928 --> 00:31:37.162
(Jeongmin) Professor Keum Saebyeok keeps saying that.

692
00:31:37.229 --> 00:31:41.066
Aren’t you asking this question from everyone you meet?
Are we sisters?

693
00:31:41.133 --> 00:31:42.267
Really?
[lively music]

694
00:31:42.334 --> 00:31:44.134
Oh my, that's a complete compliment to me?
[Jeongmin laughs]

695
00:31:44.201 --> 00:31:45.003
[Dawn’s happy laughter]

696
00:31:45.070 --> 00:31:46.338
[Clears cough at dawn]

697
00:31:46.405 --> 00:31:48.275
(Dawn) Everyone, don’t worry about me.

698
00:31:48.342 --> 00:31:51.511
Huh? I've been like this so far
How many people have reported it?

699
00:31:51.578 --> 00:31:54.648
Huh? Oh, my uterus is about to open.

700
00:31:54.715 --> 00:31:57.100
Well, if you work harder from now on
I'll be out in 10 minutes

701
00:31:57.167 --> 00:31:59.352
I know everything, really.

702
00:31:59.419 --> 00:32:01.286
VD simulation is finished

703
00:32:01.353 --> 00:32:02.728
Just getting one minute

704
00:32:02.795 --> 00:32:04.422
Do you know that it’s the same as giving birth to my child?

705
00:32:04.489 --> 00:32:06.925
So come next week
Would you like to take a look?

706
00:32:06.992 --> 00:32:08.834
Professor, when you come, just cut the umbilical cord.

707
00:32:08.901 --> 00:32:11.162
I just took the baby out
I'll wait

708
00:32:11.229 --> 00:32:13.298
- Okay, can you take a break now?
- (Dawn) Yes

709
00:32:13.365 --> 00:32:14.767
[Laughter at dawn]

710
00:32:14.834 --> 00:32:17.235
Then my water broke in the operating room!

711
00:32:17.302 --> 00:32:18.970
Don't be dragged to the delivery room to give birth.

712
00:32:19.037 --> 00:32:20.772
Ah, where is that person?

713
00:32:21.640 --> 00:32:24.309
Where are you? We've been together since before.

714
00:32:25.133 --> 00:32:26.948
[light music]
(Dawn) It’s so cool

715
00:32:27.479 --> 00:32:28.847
It's so cool

716
00:32:28.914 --> 00:32:31.015
- (Jeongmin) If you’re having a hard time, contact me again.
- (Dawn) Yes

717
00:32:31.082 --> 00:32:32.285
(Jeongmin) Good job

718
00:32:32.352 --> 00:32:33.367
(Dawn) Go

719
00:32:33.434 --> 00:32:35.067
[Sound of footsteps moving away]

720
00:32:35.134 --> 00:32:36.254
[Sigh of dawn]

721
00:32:36.321 --> 00:32:37.456
Thank you for your hard work

722
00:32:41.026 --> 00:32:43.094
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

723
00:32:43.161 --> 00:32:43.995
(Lee Young) Huh?

724
00:32:44.062 --> 00:32:45.330
Are you okay?
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

725
00:32:45.397 --> 00:32:46.533
Should I call Professor Seo Jeong-min again?

726
00:32:46.600 --> 00:32:47.801
no, no

727
00:32:47.868 --> 00:32:49.567
[Deep breath at dawn]

728
00:32:49.634 --> 00:32:51.903
Well... this is enough

729
00:32:52.704 --> 00:32:55.208
The due date might be pushed back a little?

730
00:32:55.275 --> 00:32:56.443
At best, about a day?

731
00:32:57.728 --> 00:32:59.746
You know that?

732
00:32:59.813 --> 00:33:02.849
So, I've been doing this for years.
If you pretend, you pretend.

733
00:33:02.916 --> 00:33:04.048
[cell phone ringing sound]

734
00:33:04.115 --> 00:33:06.051
Ah, that's enough

735
00:33:07.552 --> 00:33:08.620
Yes, professor

736
00:33:10.021 --> 00:33:11.525
Huh? BP suddenly?

737
00:33:11.592 --> 00:33:12.591
What about the baby?

738
00:33:13.861 --> 00:33:14.960
(Dawn) Uh...

739
00:33:15.867 --> 00:33:16.961
Don't you have any?

740
00:33:17.529 --> 00:33:18.964
Okay, I'm going now.

741
00:33:20.699 --> 00:33:21.599
[surprised gasp]
[Call end sound]

742
00:33:21.666 --> 00:33:23.501
Oh, I had surgery.

743
00:33:23.568 --> 00:33:24.469
Again?

744
00:33:25.303 --> 00:33:26.934
(Lee Young) Professor, I think you’re having a hard time.

745
00:33:27.001 --> 00:33:29.474
Hey, I'm just helping you out, but it's okay.

746
00:33:29.541 --> 00:33:30.942
Oh, Ushi

747
00:33:33.801 --> 00:33:34.913
Well then, good luck

748
00:33:36.083 --> 00:33:37.097
Where are you going?

749
00:33:39.558 --> 00:33:41.200
To eat...

750
00:33:41.267 --> 00:33:43.634
Umm, so there’s no second assistant there.

751
00:33:43.701 --> 00:33:45.400
I said I'd go with you, now

752
00:33:45.467 --> 00:33:47.058
[lively music]
Me?

753
00:33:48.260 --> 00:33:50.462
- me too?
- (Dawn) Yeah, shall we go?

754
00:33:51.029 --> 00:33:52.063
It's urgent, it's urgent

755
00:33:52.964 --> 00:33:53.932
[The difficult elasticity of dawn]

756
00:33:54.432 --> 00:33:55.667
Ah, my waist.

757
00:33:56.801 --> 00:33:57.936
It's okay

758
00:33:59.206 --> 00:34:00.110
It's okay

759
00:34:00.972 --> 00:34:02.107
thank you

760
00:34:03.942 --> 00:34:06.111
[Keyboard operation sound]
[sniffling sound]

761
00:34:13.451 --> 00:34:14.453
(Namkyung) Ah...

762
00:34:15.200 --> 00:34:16.756
Are you writing a death certificate?

763
00:34:16.823 --> 00:34:17.956
[sniffling sound]

764
00:34:19.558 --> 00:34:20.692
(temperature) yes

765
00:34:20.759 --> 00:34:21.760
(Namkyung) Yes...

766
00:34:24.000 --> 00:34:24.963
I

767
00:34:25.434 --> 00:34:26.832
Do you know why I came to the obstetrician and gynecologist?

768
00:34:28.767 --> 00:34:32.437
Not a death certificate
