1035
00:45:16.767 --> 00:45:18.084
You ate it all!

1036
00:45:18.151 --> 00:45:18.916
Aren't you going to work?

1037
00:45:18.983 --> 00:45:20.700
- (Lee Young) Why is he like this, hurry up
- (Nankyung) Hey, eat in 10 minutes!

1038
00:45:20.767 --> 00:45:22.186
(Lee Young) Well, 10 minutes, put it down, quickly.

1039
00:45:22.253 --> 00:45:23.757
[Jooyoung’s shy smile]

1040
00:45:23.824 --> 00:45:24.834
[Seungwon and Jooyoung’s laughter]

1041
00:45:24.901 --> 00:45:26.324
- Eat
- (Namkyung) Awesome

1042
00:45:31.798 --> 00:45:32.797
(Sabi) Hey, Eom Jae-il

1043
00:45:34.432 --> 00:45:35.367
(Residence in Japan) Huh?

1044
00:45:35.434 --> 00:45:37.067
Uh, uh, ah, hello?

1045
00:45:37.134 --> 00:45:38.402
Aren’t you here to buy coffee?

1046
00:45:38.469 --> 00:45:39.506
No, it's a passing road.

1047
00:45:39.573 --> 00:45:41.041
