1048
00:45:41.108 --> 00:45:42.281
I have something to say to you

1049
00:45:42.843 --> 00:45:44.756
Ah... well, that...

1050
00:45:44.823 --> 00:45:46.978
(Sabi) Teacher Kim Nam-young
They said they were sending a wedding gift.

1051
00:45:47.912 --> 00:45:49.947
Because it's food, they send it to each person's home.

1052
00:45:50.014 --> 00:45:51.882
Could you please collect the addresses of the professors?

1053
00:45:51.949 --> 00:45:53.984
I will do it from the fellow teacher until the first year.

1054
00:45:54.051 --> 00:45:56.353
Yeah, I understand.

1055
00:45:56.420 --> 00:45:57.421
(private money) and

1056
