Why again?

1057
00:46:01.165 --> 00:46:02.432
Because I found out

1058
00:46:03.160 --> 00:46:05.696
They say there are no aftereffects from sudden leg paralysis.

1059
00:46:05.763 --> 00:46:06.900
(Jay) Ah...

1060
00:46:06.967 --> 00:46:08.302
This was yesterday

1061
00:46:08.901 --> 00:46:10.067
It hurt a little

1062
00:46:10.934 --> 00:46:12.269
Oh wow!

1063
00:46:12.336 --> 00:46:13.567
I'm totally fine today

1064
00:46:13.634 --> 00:46:15.133
I thought you didn’t feel sick yesterday?

1065
00:46:15.200 --> 00:46:17.107
(Sabi) They say I have no feeling and no strength.

1066
00:46:17.174 --> 00:46:18.745
You suddenly got up and ran away.

1067
00:46:18.812 --> 00:46:20.578
Oh, when did I run away again?

1068
00:46:20.645 --> 00:46:21.381
I ran

1069
00:46:21.448 --> 00:46:22.713
I walked, slowly

1070
00:46:22.780 --> 00:46:23.534
no

1071
00:46:23.601 --> 00:46:26.317
I tried to follow along with the wheelchair.
It was so fast I couldn't keep up

1072
00:46:26.384 --> 00:46:28.452
Ah, that damn memory.

1073
00:46:29.920 --> 00:46:31.722
Oh, I don't know why I did that

1074
00:46:33.524 --> 00:46:35.359
