Give me a call, I'll do everything for you.

1090
00:47:12.997 --> 00:47:14.332
I had to go to the bathroom

1091
00:47:15.002 --> 00:47:16.434
(Dawn) Are you afraid I won’t even be able to put on NST?

1092
00:47:16.501 --> 00:47:18.135
These things are sweet even with your eyes closed, right?

1093
00:47:19.203 --> 00:47:20.171
[Lee Young sighs]

1094
00:47:22.106 --> 00:47:23.608
Did the monitor light up?

1095
