00:47:34.418 --> 00:47:37.188
Contract regular 5 to 7 minute intervals

1101
00:47:38.158 --> 00:47:39.090
[Sigh of dawn]

1102
00:47:40.358 --> 00:47:41.292
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

1103
00:47:42.560 --> 00:47:43.527
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

1104
00:47:44.228 --> 00:47:45.300
-Are you sick?
- (Dawn) Yes...

1105
00:47:45.367 --> 00:47:46.831
Which side does it hurt?
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

1106
00:47:47.365 --> 00:47:48.233
[Rough sigh at dawn]

1107
00:47:48.300 --> 00:47:49.633
Should I connect Epidural right now?

1108
00:47:49.700 --> 00:47:50.901
(Dawn) Um, no, no.

1109
00:47:51.405 --> 00:47:52.436
[Sigh of dawn]

1110
00:47:53.545 --> 00:47:55.406
Let’s look at the earthquake again and make a decision.

1111
00:47:55.473 --> 00:47:56.407
yes

1112
00:47:57.901 --> 00:47:59.810
[Deep breath at dawn]

1113
00:48:01.467 --> 00:48:02.680
[Heavy groans at dawn]

1114
00:48:06.033 --> 00:48:07.518
[Heavy breathing at dawn]

1115
00:48:07.585 --> 00:48:09.053
[Painful groans at dawn]
sorry

1116
00:48:10.421 --> 00:48:11.567
[harsh sigh]

1117
00:48:11.634 --> 00:48:12.826
It's still 2.0, right?

1118
00:48:12.893 --> 00:48:15.826
Yes, it is Felvik 2.0 and Station High.

1119
00:48:15.893 --> 00:48:16.727
[Rough sigh at dawn]

1120
00:48:17.264 --> 00:48:18.929
It's been 2 hours since I was hospitalized.

1121
00:48:19.430 --> 00:48:21.766
(Dawn) Still with contractions and Felvik
Because there is no change

1122
