1136
00:48:54.932 --> 00:48:57.301
Ah, what kind of mother are you looking at in the midst of this?

1137
00:48:57.368 --> 00:48:58.333
You don't like it?

1138
00:48:58.400 --> 00:49:00.337
Oh, it's not that I don't like it.

1139
00:49:00.404 --> 00:49:02.242
(Dawn) Then, in the meantime, I go and
