1140
00:49:02.309 --> 00:49:03.474
- Solve this again.
- (Lee Young) Oh, no, no!

1141
00:49:03.541 --> 00:49:04.908
no, no

1142
00:49:04.975 --> 00:49:05.876
no

1143
