1151
00:49:24.598 --> 00:49:27.732
Ah, why am I eating so much all of a sudden?

1152
00:49:28.535 --> 00:49:29.400
[Miyoung’s surprised gasp]

1153
00:49:30.604 --> 00:49:33.473
(Mija) At some point, I was told that I wouldn’t eat anything.

1154
00:49:33.540 --> 00:49:35.709
Now I'm saying damn it because I'm eating a lot again

1155
00:49:35.776 --> 00:49:39.143
(Miyoung) Oh, I'm afraid I'll act like that again.

1156
00:49:39.210 --> 00:49:41.681
(Mija) If you pretend, I’ll give you medicine.

1157
00:49:41.748 --> 00:49:44.266
After eating, I went back to the ward.

1158
00:49:44.333 --> 00:49:45.552
[Sound of door opening]

1159
00:49:45.619 --> 00:49:46.667
(Miyoung) Let’s walk?

1160
00:49:46.734 --> 00:49:48.252
[Sound of door closing]
Do you have the energy for that?

1161
00:49:48.319 --> 00:49:49.453
(Mija) Yes, then

1162
00:49:49.987 --> 00:49:51.522
- Hello?
- (Mija) Yes

1163
00:49:51.589 --> 00:49:52.826
[Miyoung’s sigh]

1164
00:49:52.893 --> 00:49:54.834
Teacher, you are here
[Mija's light smile]

1165
00:49:54.901 --> 00:49:56.463
I came to get that consent form.

1166
00:49:56.530 --> 00:49:58.829
