1167
00:49:58.896 --> 00:50:00.931
Teacher, today is such a beautiful day.

1168
00:50:01.432 --> 00:50:03.167
Are you doing something good?

1169
00:50:03.234 --> 00:50:04.235
[Jaeil’s laughter]

1170
00:50:04.735 --> 00:50:06.834
(Jae-il) Today I
I guess it's pretty Eom Jae-il, grandma?

1171
00:50:06.901 --> 00:50:07.738
[Mizawa Jae-il’s laughter]

1172
00:50:07.805 --> 00:50:10.207
No, why are you doing this all of a sudden?

1173
00:50:10.711 --> 00:50:13.881
Don't you want to eat something you didn't eat before?
I'm coming back to my senses

1174
00:50:13.948 --> 00:50:17.247
Ah, where did I get the energy?
Let's go exercise

1175
00:50:17.314 --> 00:50:19.683
Oh, get an albumin injection.
[Mija slurps down the soup]

1176
00:50:19.750 --> 00:50:21.819
I'm sure your condition has improved a lot.

1177
00:50:21.886 --> 00:50:22.956
The numbers have also improved a lot.

1178
00:50:23.023 --> 00:50:24.855
The man who said he was going to die until yesterday

1179
00:50:24.922 --> 00:50:27.691
(Miyoung) Why did you suddenly feel energetic?

1180
00:50:27.758 --> 00:50:29.460
What do you do when you feel energized?

1181
00:50:29.527 --> 00:50:32.062
No, it's a good thing?

1182
00:50:32.596 --> 00:50:34.965
