1183
00:50:35.032 --> 00:50:36.467
No, that's not it...

1184
00:50:39.354 --> 00:50:40.671
No

1185
00:50:40.738 --> 00:50:43.643
If you feel better, you can receive treatment well.

1186
00:50:43.710 --> 00:50:44.975
You will recover quickly too.

1187
00:50:46.577 --> 00:50:47.900
But what brought you here?

1188
00:50:47.967 --> 00:50:50.514
Oh, I'm going to start taking anti-cancer drugs later.

1189
00:50:50.581 --> 00:50:52.015
As I said before

1190
00:50:52.082 --> 00:50:55.267
Changing to a new anticancer drug
You must fill out the consent form again.

1191
00:50:55.334 --> 00:50:56.400
Can I explain this one more time?

1192
00:50:56.467 --> 00:50:58.255
Oh, I know everything, oh

1193
00:50:59.623 --> 00:51:00.658
(Japan) Yes

1194
00:51:02.426 --> 00:51:05.162
(Miyoung) I’m tired of hearing that explanation.

1195
00:51:07.401 --> 00:51:08.500
thank you

1196
00:51:18.183 --> 00:51:19.710
