1197
00:51:19.777 --> 00:51:21.111
She's not a pregnant woman at our hospital.

1198
00:51:21.178 --> 00:51:23.600
The ROM worked
There are ravers, but it's not that bad.

1199
00:51:23.667 --> 00:51:25.318
