1203
00:51:30.254 --> 00:51:33.434
As if it's no big deal
Look leisurely and elegant

1204
00:51:33.501 --> 00:51:34.434
yes

1205
00:51:34.501 --> 00:51:36.500
Remember, Gion is watching.

1206
00:51:36.567 --> 00:51:37.764
(Namkyung) Yes, keep in mind

1207
00:51:37.831 --> 00:51:38.796
Let's go

1208
00:51:42.336 --> 00:51:43.901
(Eunmi) I’m going in.
[Sound of curtain being pulled back]

1209
00:51:43.968 --> 00:51:44.835
(Namkyung) Hello?

1210
00:51:44.902 --> 00:51:46.240
[Sound of curtain hitting]
(Eunmi) Mother’s legs

1211
00:51:49.607 --> 00:51:50.744
maternal body

1212
00:51:50.811 --> 00:51:54.281
