Let me take a look

1213
00:51:54.348 --> 00:51:56.413
It may be slightly uncomfortable

1214
00:51:57.050 --> 00:51:58.433
You were very surprised, right?

1215
00:51:58.500 --> 00:52:00.918
(Namkyung) Now just trust us
Rest in peace

1216
00:52:00.985 --> 00:52:03.487
Both the baby and the mother will be fine.

1217
00:52:05.067 --> 00:52:08.061
(Temperature) I got the line
I had chemistry with CBC.

1218
00:52:08.128 --> 00:52:10.600
And the mother went to the hospital she was attending.
You said you were going again...

1219
00:52:10.667 --> 00:52:11.595
(Eunmi) No

1220
00:52:11.662 --> 00:52:13.764
I can't go to labor, I can't go!

