1225
00:52:22.518 --> 00:52:24.377
I'll upload you to the maternal surgery room, quickly.

1226
00:52:24.444 --> 00:52:25.812
- Transfer driver
- (Temperature) Yes?

1227
00:52:25.879 --> 00:52:27.333
(Namkyung) Call the transport driver, quickly!

1228
00:52:27.400 --> 00:52:28.145
Ah, yes!

1229
00:52:28.212 --> 00:52:29.079
(Eunmi) New mother
[Call connection tone]

1230
00:52:29.146 --> 00:52:32.316
