I need to go into surgery right now.

1231
00:52:32.383 --> 00:52:33.720
Driver, please come to the emergency room.

1232
00:52:33.787 --> 00:52:34.634
Uh, anesthesiology, right?

1233
00:52:34.701 --> 00:52:36.119
Uh, I'm going to give birth now.

1234
00:52:36.186 --> 00:52:37.154
It's an emergency

1235
00:52:37.667 --> 00:52:39.656
Oh, would it be better for us to have an emergency?

1236
00:52:39.723 --> 00:52:40.767
(Namkyung) Oh, it’s pediatrics, right?

1237
00:52:40.834 --> 00:52:41.892
We need to get the baby out now.

1238
00:52:42.693 --> 00:52:44.504
Oh, just you now
All you have to do is come up quickly!

1239
00:52:44.571 --> 00:52:45.930
Oh, quickly!
[Call end sound]

1240
00:52:46.501 --> 00:52:47.898
What are you doing? Did you see it?

1241
00:52:47.965 --> 00:52:50.133
Quickly call a guardian
Bring the consent form, quickly!

1242
00:52:50.200 --> 00:52:51.134
(temperature) yes

1243
00:52:51.201 --> 00:52:53.470
[Eunmi and Namgyeong talking]

1244
00:52:56.507 --> 00:52:57.841
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

1245
00:52:59.467 --> 00:53:02.367
(Lee Young) To Felvik 5.0
No change in cervix for 2 hours

1246
00:53:02.434 --> 00:53:03.914
The station is still zero

1247
00:53:04.734 --> 00:53:05.777
[The sound of trembling breathing at dawn]

1248
00:53:05.844 --> 00:53:08.285
As prescribed
Started with oxytocin 15

1249
00:53:08.352 --> 00:53:09.653
[Painful elasticity at dawn]

1250
00:53:10.320 --> 00:53:11.288
Professor, are you okay?

1251
00:53:12.089 --> 00:53:13.233
It's okay

1252
00:53:13.300 --> 00:53:14.558
[Painful breathing at dawn]
[Lee Young sighs]

1253
00:53:14.625 --> 00:53:16.526
(Dawn) Teacher Oh I-young, that...

1254
00:53:16.593 --> 00:53:17.928
What I asked for

1255
00:53:17.995 --> 00:53:19.132
Yes?

1256
00:53:19.199 --> 00:53:20.764
Later, at the birthing center

1257
00:53:21.598 --> 00:53:23.200
Interns coming to observe

1258
00:53:23.267 --> 00:53:24.501
I know, I won't forget.

1259
00:53:24.568 --> 00:53:25.569
(Dawn) Especially...

1260
00:53:26.473 --> 00:53:28.505
