(Jeongmin) Just don’t do anything wrong.
We're all watching

1516
01:03:39.033 --> 01:03:40.550
Just do what you learned

1517
01:03:41.033 --> 01:03:42.018
Don't worry

1518
01:03:45.567 --> 01:03:47.324
Oh I-young, to the position of the housekeeper.

1519
01:03:50.130 --> 01:03:51.428
[ECG meter beeping sound]

1520
01:03:55.066 --> 01:03:56.066
[Lee Young sighs]

1521
01:04:06.843 --> 01:04:08.300
(Jeongmin) It’s something I’ll be doing soon.

1522
01:04:08.367 --> 01:04:10.933
I came here saying I was a doctor.
How long are you going to stop saying you’re scared?

1523
01:04:11.000 --> 01:04:12.433
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1524
01:04:12.500 --> 01:04:13.617
The edge floats well.

1525
01:04:14.100 --> 01:04:16.723
Avoid damaging the uterine lining.

1526
01:04:16.790 --> 01:04:18.433
You know you have to take action, right?

1527
01:04:18.500 --> 01:04:20.190
(Dowon) I will do a good job as an assistant.

1528
01:04:21.328 --> 01:04:22.754
Don't worry, just get home.

1529
01:04:24.899 --> 01:04:25.996
[Lee Young sighs]

1530
01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:32.369
[ECG meter beeping sound]

1531
01:04:40.280 --> 01:04:41.333
(Jeongmin) Let’s start

1532
01:04:41.400 --> 01:04:43.049
The part where Dowon starts Inshijeon

1533
01:04:43.116 --> 01:04:44.251
Just give me a tie

1534
01:04:44.318 --> 01:04:45.232
(Dowon) Yes

1535
01:04:47.754 --> 01:04:48.818
[Lee Young’s nervous sigh]

1536
01:05:05.066 --> 01:05:06.870
(Jeongmin) Hold the thread higher and pull it

1537
01:05:07.537 --> 01:05:10.165
Yeah, I'm doing great

1538
01:05:18.685 --> 01:05:21.855
Teacher Oh I-young, what should I do?

1539
01:05:21.922 --> 01:05:23.342
(Lee Young) Please pull a little harder

1540
01:05:26.133 --> 01:05:27.624
(Jeongmin) Yes, I understand.

1541
01:05:53.554 --> 01:05:55.151
young teacher

1542
01:05:56.119 --> 01:05:58.086
Yes, what makes you uncomfortable?

1543
01:05:58.625 --> 01:06:00.457
(Mija) Did I do that again?

1544
01:06:01.033 --> 01:06:03.259
Going back and forth and talking nonsense?

1545
01:06:03.734 --> 01:06:04.766
(Jay) Ah...

1546
01:06:04.833 --> 01:06:05.729
no

1547
01:06:06.600 --> 01:06:07.797
just a few times

1548
01:06:08.700 --> 01:06:10.333
people you want to see

1549
01:06:10.400 --> 01:06:12.066
We met briefly.

1550
01:06:12.133 --> 01:06:13.002
[Mija's light smile]

1551
01:06:13.533 --> 01:06:14.838
Then

1552
01:06:15.467 --> 01:06:18.341
I miss you teacher now.

1553
01:06:21.267 --> 01:06:22.412
teacher

1554
01:06:23.367 --> 01:06:26.516
Me, when I'm sober

1555
01:06:27.300 --> 01:06:29.322
Just one thing for the teacher

1556
01:06:29.389 --> 01:06:31.621
There's something I'd like to ask you for.

1557
01:06:32.333 --> 01:06:34.491
Could you please listen?

1558
01:06:35.429 --> 01:06:36.393
What is it?

1559
01:06:38.966 --> 01:06:42.233
(Miyoung) Even if you tell me not to do that
It’s definitely like this, huh?

1560
01:06:42.300 --> 01:06:44.601
Did you secretly accept the day I would die?

1561
01:06:45.105 --> 01:06:48.433
What's good?
Do you always take pictures of the portrait?

1562
01:06:48.500 --> 01:06:50.777
Ugh! I'm stubborn too

1563
01:06:50.844 --> 01:06:54.244
It's my last greeting with people.

1564
01:06:54.781 --> 01:06:58.834
(Mija) Then
Look young and pretty even just for a day

1565
01:06:58.901 --> 01:07:00.954
It's good to see

1566
01:07:01.021 --> 01:07:03.620
It's pretty, but it's all old

1567
01:07:08.262 --> 01:07:10.332
When did you become this old?

1568
01:07:11.732 --> 01:07:12.565
[Clicking tongue]

1569
01:07:16.467 --> 01:07:19.233
You're older than my mom, my sister

1570
01:07:19.300 --> 01:07:20.837
Mom is

1571
01:07:21.341 --> 01:07:24.274
That's because I went to 50

1572
01:07:26.500 --> 01:07:27.577
But you

1573
01:07:31.185 --> 01:07:34.117
My little sister is so pretty

1574
01:07:34.966 --> 01:07:36.219
(Mija) It’s pretty

1575
01:07:38.292 --> 01:07:39.422
It's pretty

1576
01:07:39.489 --> 01:07:40.899
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1577
01:07:40.966 --> 01:07:42.892
I'm also in the 7th grade, class 5.

1578
01:07:43.734 --> 01:07:45.999
Still in my eyes

1579
01:07:46.066 --> 01:07:49.169
My younger brother will be with me forever

1580
01:07:49.736 --> 01:07:50.702
Go and

1581
01:07:52.172 --> 01:07:53.866
Oh, take a picture quickly.

1582
01:07:53.933 --> 01:07:55.405
That teacher is busy too

1583
01:07:57.244 --> 01:07:58.241
(Japanese) Grandmother

1584
01:07:58.946 --> 01:08:01.615
The model and background are perfect, that Japchae

1585
01:08:02.166 --> 01:08:03.246
[Jaeil’s laughter]

1586
01:08:05.438 --> 01:08:07.300
(Miyoung) Where did you get the camera?

1587
01:08:07.367 --> 01:08:09.652
My bag, I have everything in it.

1588
01:08:11.792 --> 01:08:13.823
(Jaeil) Okay, I’ll take a picture.

1589
01:08:14.600 --> 01:08:15.658
You can see it here

1590
01:08:16.763 --> 01:08:19.699
one, two, three

1591
01:08:19.766 --> 01:08:20.997
Mite!

1592
01:08:21.064 --> 01:08:22.599
[camera shutter sound]
[Miyoung’s absurd laughter]

1593
01:08:23.567 --> 01:08:25.368
Oh, pretty.

1594
01:08:27.766 --> 01:08:31.244
I printed this
I'll give it to you the next time you come for chemotherapy.

1595
01:08:31.311 --> 01:08:33.580
yes, thank you

1596
01:08:33.647 --> 01:08:34.591
[Jaeil’s light smile]

1597
01:08:36.367 --> 01:08:38.367
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST-Continued]

1598
01:08:44.467 --> 01:08:46.026
Would you like to take a picture together?

1599
01:08:46.093 --> 01:08:47.732
Oh, that's it.

1600
01:08:47.799 --> 01:08:49.659
I'm all old, so what's wrong with the photos?

1601
01:08:50.497 --> 01:08:51.959
This camera is good

1602
01:08:52.634 --> 01:08:53.633
Oh, I don't.

1603
01:08:53.700 --> 01:08:57.433
Baby, take a picture, just one, okay?

1604
01:08:57.500 --> 01:08:59.233
Ah, that's it.

1605
01:08:59.300 --> 01:09:00.907
Quickly!

1606
01:09:00.974 --> 01:09:02.866
I'm so behind on that work

1607
01:09:02.933 --> 01:09:04.607
- (Japan) I have to go, quickly.
- (Miyoung) Oh, really

1608
01:09:09.467 --> 01:09:11.047
(Jaeil) Ah, it’s pretty.

1609
01:09:11.567 --> 01:09:13.366
You two look like girls.

1610
01:09:13.433 --> 01:09:14.584
[Jaeil’s laughter]

1611
01:09:15.261 --> 01:09:17.734
Now, smile comfortably.

1612
01:09:17.801 --> 01:09:18.922
I'll take a picture

1613
01:09:20.327 --> 01:09:22.552
cheese

1614
01:09:22.619 --> 01:09:23.726
[camera shutter sound]

1615
01:09:26.533 --> 01:09:27.630
I'll take one more picture

1616
01:09:29.336 --> 01:09:30.474
[sigh]

1617
01:09:37.367 --> 01:09:38.308
Now

1618
01:09:40.009 --> 01:09:42.445
one, two, three

1619
01:09:44.013 --> 01:09:45.048
[camera shutter sound]

1620
01:09:49.656 --> 01:09:52.162
(Do-won) He said he would receive his baby himself.

1621
01:09:53.000 --> 01:09:54.728
(Jeongmin) You didn’t take labor pains lightly.

1622
01:09:54.795 --> 01:09:56.997
How much does that hurt?

1623
01:09:57.064 --> 01:09:58.895
Compare it to receiving someone else's child?

1624
01:10:00.767 --> 01:10:01.968
however

1625
01:10:02.035 --> 01:10:03.999
The long-standing legend of our mountains

1626
01:10:04.066 --> 01:10:05.468
Will it work for Oh Yi-young too?

1627
01:10:06.206 --> 01:10:08.766
Obstetrics professor, attending physician, does obstetrics

1628
01:10:08.833 --> 01:10:10.200
Didn't you hear that?

1629
01:10:10.267 --> 01:10:11.200
I've heard of it, I

1630
01:10:11.267 --> 01:10:13.600
I am also our professor
He was my doctor when I gave birth.

1631
01:10:13.667 --> 01:10:15.866
Dawn was Seok-Hoon’s doctor when he was born.

1632
01:10:15.933 --> 01:10:17.100
Oh, when you have your second child?

1633
01:10:17.167 --> 01:10:18.066
(Jeongmin) Yes

1634
01:10:18.133 --> 01:10:20.534
We were both thinking about doing it with our wives.

1635
01:10:20.601 --> 01:10:24.667
For the first time in my life when I was delivered by a professor.
I had my uterus sewn up and had obstetrics.

1636
01:10:24.734 --> 01:10:25.966
(Dowon) Hmm

1637
01:10:26.033 --> 01:10:28.300
(Jeongmin) That legend
I don't know if it's been a while since I've gotten through it

1638
01:10:28.367 --> 01:10:32.032
In my opinion, more than a legend
Do you think eating or sleeping would be easier?

1639
01:10:32.099 --> 01:10:33.061
(Jeongmin) Really?

1640
01:10:33.563 --> 01:10:36.232
Then, let’s congratulate and flirt.

1641
01:10:36.734 --> 01:10:37.700
go out together

1642
01:10:37.767 --> 01:10:39.835
Should I ask you out for dinner, something delicious?

1643
01:10:39.902 --> 01:10:42.575
(Dowon) Oh, can I eat today?

1644
01:10:43.710 --> 01:10:44.878
[Jeongmin sighs]

1645
01:10:44.945 --> 01:10:45.809
(Jeongmin) Right?

1646
01:10:47.533 --> 01:10:49.512
For the first time, in the position of the housekeeper

1647
01:10:50.100 --> 01:10:51.381
The uterus was also sewn up.

1648
01:10:51.933 --> 01:10:53.333
I closed the boat alone.

1649
01:10:53.400 --> 01:10:55.999
Maybe my heart is still shaking

1650
01:10:56.066 --> 01:10:57.633
I don’t think it will even go through the water?

1651
01:10:57.700 --> 01:10:59.956
Okay, let's eat next time.

1652
01:11:01.033 --> 01:11:02.614
(Jeongmin) Ugh, Oh Iyoung

1653
01:11:04.131 --> 01:11:06.029
Ah, I slept all today.

1654
01:11:07.667 --> 01:11:08.998
[Sound of door opening]

1655
01:11:10.634 --> 01:11:12.201
[Sound of door closing]

1656
01:11:17.344 --> 01:11:18.270
(Lee Young) Yes

1657
01:11:20.267 --> 01:11:22.182
You called me, right? Right?

1658
01:11:22.249 --> 01:11:23.128
yes?

1659
01:11:23.966 --> 01:11:25.748
I think the professor called me this morning.

1660
01:11:26.966 --> 01:11:28.718
(Lee Young) Is it bleeding? Where are you hurting?

1661
01:11:29.223 --> 01:11:30.286
I didn't hear anything?

1662
01:11:43.637 --> 01:11:45.038
[Sigh of dawn]

1663
01:11:45.105 --> 01:11:46.366
(Dawn) Teacher Oh I-young

1664
01:11:46.433 --> 01:11:49.338
How many times are you watching this?

1665
01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:51.040
(Lee Young) I’m anxious

1666
01:11:51.600 --> 01:11:53.209
This is my first time having a uterus removed.

1667
01:11:53.734 --> 01:11:56.567
When I was treating my skin earlier,
It seems like it was pulled a little too hard.

1668
01:11:56.634 --> 01:11:58.018
[light sigh]

1669
01:11:58.085 --> 01:12:00.734
It's okay, that's how it goes

1670
01:12:00.801 --> 01:12:01.851
[Painful groans at dawn]

1671
01:12:04.667 --> 01:12:06.622
But did you pull it too hard?

1672
01:12:09.066 --> 01:12:10.560
(Chaeryeong) Professor, this is my first time seeing something like this.

1673
01:12:11.533 --> 01:12:14.263
I was in the obstetrics ward of another hospital.
It was there for about a year?

1674
01:12:14.899 --> 01:12:17.200
But the dressing area like this
This is my first time seeing something so clean.

1675
01:12:17.267 --> 01:12:18.699
[light laughter]

1676
01:12:18.766 --> 01:12:21.274
I also taught you how to treat your skin.

1677
01:12:21.341 --> 01:12:22.505
(Lee Young) I think it’s okay

1678
01:12:24.400 --> 01:12:25.274
[Clears cough at dawn]

1679
01:12:27.866 --> 01:12:29.400
Then 1 hour later

1680
01:12:29.467 --> 01:12:31.166
I'll come back to see if there's any bleeding.

1681
01:12:31.233 --> 01:12:33.600
(Dawn) What’s coming again?
Get some sleep, get some sleep!

1682
01:12:33.667 --> 01:12:34.721
(Lee Young) See you later
[Sound of door opening and closing]

1683
01:12:34.788 --> 01:12:35.918
(Dawn) Oh, really

1684
01:12:38.592 --> 01:12:39.989
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

1685
01:12:40.794 --> 01:12:43.152
(Lee Young) Oh, perhaps
Is it because of me that you couldn’t get off work?

1686
01:12:43.966 --> 01:12:44.861
(Chaeryeong) Yes

1687
01:12:46.200 --> 01:12:48.331
(Lee Young) I’m sorry, you can go.

1688
01:12:48.969 --> 01:12:50.167
[Chaeryeong’s light smile]

1689
01:12:50.234 --> 01:12:53.033
(Chaeryeong) It’s not that I couldn’t get off work.
I didn't do it

1690
01:12:53.100 --> 01:12:54.537
To pay off my debt to my teacher

1691
01:12:57.200 --> 01:12:59.942
I tried to pay it back little by little starting today.

1692
01:13:00.734 --> 01:13:02.745
That didn't help, did it?

1693
01:13:04.200 --> 01:13:05.348
When will you pay it all back?

1694
01:13:06.753 --> 01:13:08.518
(Lee Young) Oh, no, what is the debt?

1695
01:13:09.533 --> 01:13:10.887
There is no such thing

1696
01:13:13.894 --> 01:13:14.885
(Chaeryeong) Huh?

1697
01:13:28.542 --> 01:13:30.615
(Director) Now, let me take a look before I do anything.

1698
01:13:31.700 --> 01:13:33.146
Even if you applied anesthetic cream

1699
01:13:33.213 --> 01:13:35.949
I say it stings because it can sting.
[dark music]

1700
01:13:36.016 --> 01:13:37.858
You must not move.

1701
01:13:37.925 --> 01:13:40.223
If it stings, raise your right hand.

1702
01:13:40.821 --> 01:13:42.207
You know, right?
[Sound of door opening]

1703
01:13:43.400 --> 01:13:45.400
[Medical device operation sound]

1704
01:13:48.124 --> 01:13:51.194
(Chaeryeong) After that incident
I couldn't contact the teacher.

1705
01:13:52.833 --> 01:13:56.532
For no reason, because of me, a senior doctor
There was a rumor that he punched you.

1706
01:13:58.166 --> 01:14:01.333
Basically, rumors spread quickly.

1707
01:14:01.400 --> 01:14:02.405
So

1708
01:14:03.634 --> 01:14:06.342
It wasn't a punch, it was a biting.

1709
01:14:07.981 --> 01:14:10.449
[Director’s scream]
[Interesting music]

1710
01:14:10.516 --> 01:14:12.018
[Dog growling sound effect]

1711
01:14:12.085 --> 01:14:13.699
Hey, hey, you crazy bastard!

1712
01:14:13.766 --> 01:14:16.233
(Director) Hey, hey, my hand!

1713
01:14:16.300 --> 01:14:17.301
my surgery

1714
01:14:17.368 --> 01:14:19.559
I need surgery on this hand, please!

1715
01:14:19.626 --> 01:14:20.961
Okay, ah!

1716
01:14:21.028 --> 01:14:22.558
[Director’s scream]
[Dog barking sound effect]

1717
01:14:23.063 --> 01:14:24.360
That dermatology clinic went out of business.

1718
01:14:25.533 --> 01:14:27.930
My reputation for not having any skills got worse.

1719
01:14:30.066 --> 01:14:31.033
[surprised elasticity]

1720
01:14:31.734 --> 01:14:34.341
Hand bitten by teacher
I think it started happening right after that?

1721
01:14:34.408 --> 01:14:35.266
uh?

1722
01:14:35.333 --> 01:14:36.305
Is that what you asked?

1723
01:14:37.010 --> 01:14:37.884
[laughter]

1724
01:14:40.108 --> 01:14:42.311
(Lee Young) There hasn’t been anyone else like that since then, right?

1725
01:14:43.400 --> 01:14:44.380
Sure

1726
01:14:44.866 --> 01:14:46.949
These days, only I touch myself.

1727
01:14:47.588 --> 01:14:49.518
Oh, thank goodness

1728
01:14:54.899 --> 01:14:56.466
[Calm music]
[Surprisingly] Ah, an hour has passed.

1729
01:14:56.533 --> 01:14:57.627
I'll go first

1730
01:14:58.504 --> 01:14:59.266
Where are you going?

1731
01:14:59.333 --> 01:15:00.963
(Lee Young) I’m going to see Professor Keum Saebyeok.

1732
01:15:01.030 --> 01:15:04.133
(Chaeryeong) Oh, you told me to stop coming.
Did you tell me to leave work now?

1733
01:15:04.200 --> 01:15:05.601
(Lee Young) I’m worried that it might bleed

1734
01:15:05.668 --> 01:15:07.470
I'll just watch it one more time

1735
01:15:09.409 --> 01:15:10.473
[Chaeryeong’s light smile]

1736
01:15:11.066 --> 01:15:12.612
(Chaeryeong) Let’s go together, teacher!

1737
01:15:12.679 --> 01:15:13.999
(Lee Young) Oh, get off work!

1738
01:15:14.066 --> 01:15:15.230
(Chaeryeong) Ah, let’s go together

1739
01:15:15.297 --> 01:15:16.450
(Lee Young) Are you busy?

1740
01:15:16.517 --> 01:15:17.647
(Chaeryeong) I’m not busy.

1741
01:15:23.033 --> 01:15:24.487
[Message incoming sound]

1742
01:15:29.133 --> 01:15:30.493
Ah, the return gift address.

1743
01:15:30.966 --> 01:15:32.695
[Message incoming sound]

1744
01:15:35.335 --> 01:15:37.335
[Interesting music]

1745
01:15:39.066 --> 01:15:41.137
[cell phone ringing sound]

1746
01:15:43.443 --> 01:15:44.350
Uh, Namkyung.

1747
01:15:46.000 --> 01:15:47.866
I like warm herbal tea.

1748
01:15:47.933 --> 01:15:48.978
Hey, Lee Young and...

1749
01:15:49.734 --> 01:15:51.681
No, let's talk in the medical office.

1750
01:15:52.560 --> 01:15:53.624
Uh, come quickly.

1751
01:15:54.454 --> 01:15:55.339
[Call end sound]

1752
01:15:59.059 --> 01:16:00.721
(Namkyung) Huh? Teacher Gu Do-won?

1753
01:16:00.788 --> 01:16:01.561
(Dowon) Oh

1754
01:16:01.628 --> 01:16:02.699
(Namkyung) Oh, that’s right

1755
01:16:02.766 --> 01:16:04.667
I thought it wasn't that teacher

1756
01:16:04.734 --> 01:16:07.334
Does wearing a hat make you look like a different person?

1757
01:16:07.401 --> 01:16:09.069
My head is pressed down by the surgical cap.

1758
01:16:09.136 --> 01:16:10.166
(Namkyung) Ah...

1759
01:16:10.766 --> 01:16:11.899
Where are you going?

1760
01:16:11.966 --> 01:16:13.033
To eat

1761
01:16:13.100 --> 01:16:15.166
- (Nanjing) Where?
- In front of the hospital

1762
01:16:15.233 --> 01:16:16.200
With whom?

1763
01:16:16.267 --> 01:16:17.699
Sister-in-law, why?

1764
01:16:17.766 --> 01:16:18.907
Can you tell me what to eat?

1765
01:16:18.974 --> 01:16:19.980
no

1766
01:16:20.047 --> 01:16:22.224
I wonder if she's his girlfriend

1767
